From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: premohq <48417750+premohq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 18:39:36 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] PS5-ECAM's Switch 2 side: the HUD's pipeline made on the
 window pass's own render pass again

#109 changed the HUD pipeline's render pass from render_pass to renderpass, the raw handle
(VkRenderPass renderpass{*render_pass}) the in-game menu's target takes. Eden's
CreateWrappedCoverageBlendingPipeline wants the wrapper (vk::RenderPass&), so vulkan_window_adapt_pass.cpp
did not compile. The same render pass either way; the in-game menu keeps the raw handle.
---
 headless/vulkan_hud_prepare.inc | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/headless/vulkan_hud_prepare.inc b/headless/vulkan_hud_prepare.inc
index f35e779..cd05544 100644
--- a/headless/vulkan_hud_prepare.inc
+++ b/headless/vulkan_hud_prepare.inc
@@ -9,7 +9,7 @@
         auto vertex = BuildShader(device, EDEN_HUD_VERT_SPV);
         auto fragment = BuildShader(device, EDEN_HUD_FRAG_SPV);
         hud_pipeline = CreateWrappedCoverageBlendingPipeline(
-            device, renderpass, hud_layout, std::tie(vertex, fragment));
+            device, render_pass, hud_layout, std::tie(vertex, fragment));
     }
     const VkPipeline hud_graphics_pipeline = *hud_pipeline;
     const VkPipelineLayout hud_pipeline_layout = *hud_layout;
